      "evidence": "The deck has 6 slides. The criterion defines 6 or fewer slides as a fail. The Storydoc benchmark identifies ~10-slide decks as achieving the highest completion rates (32% vs. 22% average). The deck is missing 6 slides the seed framework expects — Market, Competition, Business Model, Why Now, GTM, and Financials — each of which addresses a question investors ask in first meetings. Adding them would bring the count to 10–12 slides.",
